{
  "_about": [
    "Every league the hub tracks, read by the sync scripts, index.html and the deploy-workers workflow.",
    "name: must match the league's name on the site. id: the CURRENT season's league ID. The Sleeper sync",
    "updates the id itself when a league renews for a new season, so this rarely needs a hand edit.",
    "playoff_start_week: first playoff week, keyed by the first season it applies to (the latest key <= season wins).",
    "playoff_teams: teams that make the playoffs. third_place_game: false when the league plays no 3rd-place game.",
    "exclude_from_records: true leaves the league out of Hall of Records, Playoff Odds and award tabs.",
    "Fleaflicker-only fields: start_season, end_season (league moved away), merge_into (splice history into that league).",
    "RSO-only (platform \"rso\"): no public API, so scripts/build_rso.py rebuilds it from the snapshot in rso/; the syncs and workers skip it."
  ],
